OL,3,AChildren as young as six going to A&E
OL,4,Ain mental health crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been a sharp rise in children
OL,7,Fand young people - some as young as six
OL,8,F- attending A&E units in England in a
OL,9,Fmental health crisis, NHS doctors are
OL,10,Fwarning.
OL,12,FThe number of six to 17-year-olds
OL,13,Fturning up in significant distress for
OL,14,Fthings like self-harm and eating
OL,15,Fdisorders, or in emotional crisis, rose
OL,16,Fby 36% between 2019 and 2025, according
OL,17,Fto the Royal College of Paediatrics and
OL,18,FChild Health analysis.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
